Usage: nexo worktree <subcommand>
Create or extract Git worktrees.

Subcommands:
  create   Create and open a Git worktree.
  extract  Move a checkout's branch into a new worktree.

Examples:
  nexo worktree create --new-branch ~/src/api feature/api ~/worktrees/api
  nexo worktree extract --return-branch main ~/src/api ~/worktrees/api

Run 'nexo worktree <subcommand> --help' for more.
